    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break blocks like never before\u2026 on Mars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience explosive arcade action in Breakthrough Mars, where reflexes and strategy converge as you demolish alien structures on the red planet\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfaf Classic arcade action: inspired by the legendary brick\u2011breakers of the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\ude80 Unique space setting: detailed Martian environments filled with cosmic hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u26a1 Spectacular power\u2011ups: multiply the ball, fire lasers, manipulate gravity, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udde9 Increasing challenges: from relaxed levels to full\u2011on brick\u2011wall battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf0d Multilingual: available in Spanish, English, and more, with quality localization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why play it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because Breakthrough Mars isn\u2019t just about breaking blocks\u2014it\u2019s about reliving arcade magic with modern physics, a retro\u2011futuristic vibe, and a pace that hooks you from level one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your skills and conquer Mars\u2026 one block at a time.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break blocks like never before\u2026 on Mars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience explosive arcade action in Breakthrough Mars, where reflexes and strategy converge as you demolish alien structures on the red planet\u2019s surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udfaf Classic arcade action: inspired by the legendary brick\u2011breakers of the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83d\ude80 Unique space setting: detailed Martian environments filled with cosmic hazards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \u26a1 Spectacular power\u2011ups: multiply the ball, fire lasers, manipulate gravity, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83e\udde9 Increasing challenges: from relaxed levels to full\u2011on brick\u2011wall battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- \ud83c\udf0d Multilingual: available in Spanish, English, and more, with quality localization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why play it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because Breakthrough Mars isn\u2019t just about breaking blocks\u2014it\u2019s about reliving arcade magic with modern physics, a retro\u2011futuristic vibe, and a pace that hooks you from level one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your skills and conquer Mars\u2026 one block at a time.</p>",
